{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/998026-licensing-and-copywrite","id":998026,"title":"Licensing and Copywrite","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-11-03T19:43:54-07:00","id":998026,"title":"Licensing and Copywrite","content":"Hi everyone,<br /> <br /> I am considering making a computer RPG based on Vampire: The Requiem 2nd edition and the Criminal Intent Storytelling Adventure System module.<br /> <br /> What steps do I need to take before I can publish such a game commercially, such as on Steam? Will there be royalties or licensing fees? What if I were to make the game available for free?<br /> <br /> TIA","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4824-logicalunit","name":"LogicalUnit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T20:15:12-07:00","id":998041,"title":"","content":"To be totally frank: you're definitely not going to be able to put anything with Chronicles of Darkness licensed content on Steam, even if it's free. You'd be better off taking inspiration from the module and making something with original names.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T20:19:43-07:00","id":998044,"title":"","content":"Three answers come to mind.<br /> <br /> 1) Make a <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UvCri1tqIxQ\" target=\"_blank\">minimum viable product</a> and pitch it to Paradox Entertainment, see if they are willing to license it. Companies are more likely to pay attention to an actual product rather than an idea, and while it's not in Paradox's plans to give any shits about Chronicles of Darkness anytime soon, something concrete in their laps might change their mind, if the cost isn't too much.<br /> <br /> 2) Don't do it at all. Seriously, copyright law is a minefield, and even with as much as I have studied the subject as a communications student, I couldn't tell you any way to stay safe-you'd need some dedicated experts on the subject to do it without getting hit for non-profit. If you want to publish the game commercially, you're pretty much looking at being completely underground with the understanding that if you ever get caught, it might cost you for years to come.<br /> <br /> 3) Rebrand and forestall. Don't make a game in Vampire the Requiem, and instead create your own thing that runs parallel. Hell, if you go all the way to releasing that product and getting a sales base, and then say you'd like to use this game as the basis for a Requiem game to Paradox, they might be even more inclined to listen. Even if it doesn't, you're product being informed by that goal gives you some clear directions, and the need to divorce it from the identity will bring out your own creativity, so if Paradox doesn't buy it from you, you still have a foot in the door in the market and can go do your own thing.<br /> <br /> I say all of this, but it should be noted that one of the big blessings and curses of Chronicles of Darkness being owned by Paradox is that Paradox has essentially written Chronicles off as merely a profitable side thing and has no real interest in actually doing anything with it-they have zero intentions at this time of doing any kind of expanded media with Chronicles materials, and exploration in that subject is very controlled. In particular, Paradox is a video game company, so their decision means that while audio plays might be permitted, a video game is definitely encroaching on the limits of their focus and finances-they probably <i>really</i> have no interest in a ChroD video game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T21:40:05-07:00","id":998080,"title":"","content":"The last time I asked this same question, I was redirected to the IP owner, who didn't even bother responding to my inquiry. I honestly would not expect Paradox to act differently.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I call the Integrity-analogue the &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822559-trying-to-understand-the-morality-system?p=825008#post825008\" target=\"_blank\">subjective stat</a>&quot;.<br /> An explanation how to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/913221-using-social-manuevering\" target=\"_blank\">use Social Manuevering</a>.<br /> Guanxi Explanations: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=787824#post787824\" target=\"_blank\">1</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=788173#post788173\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/833863-mages-and-trading-favors?p=834531#post834531\" target=\"_blank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T21:42:26-07:00","id":998081,"title":"","content":"No, if you're going to try and make a dent, you would need to run them down in the flesh, and you'd have to have a good reason for it, and you better have a hell of a pitch and a damn fun MVP.<br /> <br /> You'll probably lose.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}